{"id":"GHSA-j82w-28jv-3pmj","axis":"advisories","repo":"sporkmonger/addressable","sha":"26d1e9e8409a861571f9d0029022b6e9b9158b5e","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -14,6 +14,11 @@"," - deprecates `Addressable::URI::RULE_2A`, `RULE_2B_2C`, `RULE_2D` and","   `RULE_PREFIXED_PARENT`, which are no longer used; they will be removed in","   2.10.0","+- fixes denial of service in `Addressable::Template#match` and `#extract`,","+  which still backtracked exponentially in 2.9.0 for exploded `/`, `.`, `;`,","+  `?` and `&` expressions (e.g. `{/path*}`) on regex engines without match","+  memoization, such as JRuby, TruffleRuby and MRI before 3.2; match results","+  are unchanged (GHSA-j82w-28jv-3pmj)"," - fixes `Addressable::URI#route_from` and `#route_to` raising","   `InvalidURIError` when the route's first segment contains a colon","   (e.g. `/a:b` from `/a`); the route is now `./a:b` ([#625])"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"lib/addressable/template.rb","lines":["@@ -1024,12 +1024,22 @@ def parse_new_template_pattern(pattern, processor = nil)","               \"#{ UNRESERVED }*?\"","             end","             if modifier == '*'","+              # The ; ? and & members match the same strings, in the same","+              # order of preference, as 2.9.0's members joined by an optional","+              # joiner, but each character can only belong to one member.","               seg = case operator","                     when '+', '#' then \"#{RESERVED_NO_COMMA}*+\"","+                    when ';' then \"(?:#{UNRESERVED}|=)*\"","+                    when '?', '&'","+                      \"#{UNRESERVED}*=(?:#{UNRESERVED}*=)*#{UNRESERVED}*?\"","                     else group","                     end","-              joiner_pattern = operator.nil? ? joiner : \"#{joiner}?\"","-              \"(?<#{name}>#{seg}(?:#{joiner_pattern}#{seg})*)?\"","+              # The joiner between exploded members must be mandatory. With","+              # an optional joiner, a run of members can be partitioned in","+              # exponentially many ways, which backtracks catastrophically on","+              # engines without match memoization (MRI < 3.2, JRuby,","+              # TruffleRuby).","+              \"(?<#{name}>#{seg}(?:#{joiner}#{seg})*)?\"","             elsif varspecs.size > 1 && (operator == '+' || operator == '#') &&","                   varspec != varspecs.last","               \"(?<#{name}>#{RESERVED_NO_COMMA}*+)?\""],"additions":12,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"spec/addressable/template_match_spec.rb","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,176 @@","+# frozen_string_literal: true","+","+# Copyright (C) Bob Aman","+#","+#    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");","+#    you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.","+#    You may obtain a copy of the License at","+#","+#        http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0","+#","+#    Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software","+#    distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,","+#    WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.","+#    See the License for the specific language governing permissions and","+#    limitations under the License.","+","+","+require \"spec_helper\"","+","+require \"timeout\"","+require \"addressable/template\"","+","+module TemplateMatchSpec","+  UNRESERVED = Addressable::Template::UNRESERVED","+  RESERVED_NO_COMMA = Addressable::Template::RESERVED_NO_COMMA","+","+  # The exploded member patterns from Addressable 2.9.0. Members were joined","+  # by an optional joiner, except for the default operator.","+  LEGACY_MEMBERS = {","+    nil => \"#{UNRESERVED}*?\",","+    \"+\" => \"#{RESERVED_NO_COMMA}*+\",","+    \"#\" => \"#{RESERVED_NO_COMMA}*+\",","+    \"/\" => \"#{UNRESERVED}*?\",","+    \".\" => \"#{UNRESERVED.gsub('\\.', '')}*?\",","+    \";\" => \"#{UNRESERVED}*=?#{UNRESERVED}*?\",","+    \"?\" => \"#{UNRESERVED}*=#{UNRESERVED}*?\",","+    \"&\" => \"#{UNRESERVED}*=#{UNRESERVED}*?\"","+  }","+","+  def self.leader(operator)","+    Addressable::Template::LEADERS.fetch(operator, \"\")","+  end","+","+  def self.joiner(operator)","+    Addressable::Template::JOINERS.fetch(operator, \",\")","+  end","+","+  # The regular expression 2.9.0 generated for \"{<operator>a*}\".","+  def self.legacy_expression(operator)","+    member = LEGACY_MEMBERS.fetch(operator)","+    joiner = Regexp.escape(joiner(operator))","+    joiner = \"#{joiner}?\" unless operator.nil?","+    \"(?:|#{Regexp.escape(leader(operator))}\" \\","+      \"(?<a>#{member}(?:#{joiner}#{member})*)?)\"","+  end","+","+  # The regular expression generated now for \"{<operator>a*}\".","+  def self.expression(operator)","+    pattern = \"{#{operator}a*}\"","+    _, regexp = Addressable::Template.new(pattern).send(","+      :parse_template_pattern, pattern","+    )","+    regexp.source[/\\A\\\\A(.*)\\\\z\\z/m, 1]","+  end","+","+  # Every position at which the expression can stop matching a prefix of the","+  # string, in the order that the regular expression engine tries them. Two","+  # expressions that give the same order behave the same way wherever they","+  # appear in a template.","+  def self.end_positions(expression, string)","+    remaining = (0..string.size).to_a","+    order = []","+    until remaining.empty?","+      stops = remaining.map { |index| \"(?=.{#{string.size - index}}\\\\z)\" }","+      match = Regexp.new(","+        \"\\\\A#{expression}(?:#{stops.join(\"|\")})\", Regexp::MULTILINE","+      ).match(string)","+      break unless match","+      order << match[0].size","+      remaining.delete(match[0].size)","+    end","+    order","+  end","+","+  # Every string of up to max_length tokens drawn from alphabet.","+  def self.strings(alphabet, max_length)","+    (0..max_length).flat_map do |length|","+      alphabet.repeated_permutation(length).map(&:join)","+    end.uniq","+  end","+end","+","+describe Addressable::Template, \"#match with exploded variables\" do","+  context \"compared with 2.9.0\" do","+    {","+      [\"{;b*}\", \";b==a\"] => {\"b\" => {\"b\" => \"\"}},","+      [\"{;a*}\", \";a=b=c;d\"] => {\"a\" => {\"a\" => \"b\", \"d\" => \"\"}},","+      [\"{;a*}\", \";a;;b\"] => {\"a\" => {\"a\" => \"\", nil => \"\", \"b\" => \"\"}},","+      [\"{&b*}\", \"&k=ab%3Bb=\"] => {\"b\" => {\"k\" => \"ab;b\"}},","+      [\"{?a*}\", \"?a=b=c&d=e\"] => {\"a\" => {\"a\" => \"b\", \"d\" => \"e\"}},","+      [\"{?a*}\", \"?a=bc=d\"] => {\"a\" => {\"a\" => \"bc\"}},","+      [\"{;b*,c*}\", \";n=ak=ab;c=a2Cb\"] => {","+        \"b\" => {\"n\" => \"ak\", \"c\" => \"a2Cb\"}, \"c\" => {}","+      },","+      [\"{?a*,a*,a*}\", \"?a=aba=ab&a=ab\"] => {\"a\" => {\"a\" => \"ab\"}},","+      [\"{?a*,c*}\", \"?a=b=c&d=e\"] => {","+        \"a\" => {\"a\" => \"b\", \"d\" => \"e\"}, \"c\" => nil","+      },","+      [\"{&a*}{&b}\", \"&x=1=2&b=3\"] => {","+        \"a\" => {\"x\" => \"1\", \"b\" => \"3\"}, \"b\" => nil","+      },","+      [\"{;a*}{?b*}\", \";a=1;b?c=d=e\"] => {","+        \"a\" => {\"a\" => \"1\", \"b\" => \"\"}, \"b\" => {\"c\" => \"d\"}","+      },","+      [\"{/a*}{/b}\", \"/x/y/z\"] => {\"a\" => [\"x\", \"y\", \"z\"], \"b\" => nil},","+      [\"{.a*}{.b}\", \".x.y.z\"] => {\"a\" => [\"x\", \"y\", \"z\"], \"b\" => nil},","+      [\"{a*}{b}\", \"x,y,z\"] => {\"a\" => [\"x,y,\"], \"b\" => \"z\"}","+    }.each do |(pattern, uri), mapping|","+      it \"matches #{uri.inspect} against #{pattern} as 2.9.0 did\" do","+        expect(Addressable::Template.new(pattern).match(uri).mapping).to eq(","+          mapping","+        )","+      end","+    end","+","+    TemplateMatchSpec::LEGACY_MEMBERS.each_key do |operator|","+      it \"tries the same end positions in the same order for \" \\","+          \"{#{operator}a*}\" do","+        legacy = TemplateMatchSpec.legacy_expression(operator)","+        current = TemplateMatchSpec.expression(operator)","+        alphabet = [","+          TemplateMatchSpec.leader(operator),","+          TemplateMatchSpec.joiner(operator),","+          \"a\", \"=\", \"%41\"","+        ].reject(&:empty?).uniq","+        TemplateMatchSpec.strings(alphabet, 5).each do |string|","+          expect(TemplateMatchSpec.end_positions(current, string)).to eq(","+            TemplateMatchSpec.end_positions(legacy, string)","+          ), \"for #{string.inspect}\"","+        end","+      end","+    end","+  end","+","+  context \"with adversarial input\" do","+    {","+      \"{/foo*}\" => \"/\" + (\"%41/\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{/foo*}{?q*}\" => \"/\" + (\"a/\" * 500) + \"?\" + (\"a=\" * 500) + \"!\",","+      \"{/foo*,bar}\" => \"/\" + (\"a/\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{/foo*}.json\" => \"/\" + (\"a/\" * 1000) + \".jso\",","+      \"{/foo*} (empty members)\" => (\"/\" * 2000) + \"!\",","+      \"{.foo*} (empty members)\" => (\".\" * 2000) + \"!\",","+      \"x{.foo*}{;bar*}\" => \"x.\" + (\"a.\" * 500) + \";\" + (\"a=\" * 500) + \"!\",","+      \"{foo*} (empty members)\" => (\",\" * 2000) + \"!\",","+      \"{;foo*}\" => \";\" + (\"a=\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{;foo*} (percent-encoded)\" => \";\" + (\"%41=\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{;foo*} (empty members)\" => (\";\" * 2000) + \"!\",","+      \"{;foo*} (equals signs)\" => \";\" + (\"=\" * 2000) + \"!\",","+      \"{;foo*,bar}\" => \";\" + (\"a=\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{?foo*}\" => \"?\" + (\"a=\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{?foo*} (percent-encoded)\" => \"?\" + (\"%41=\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{?foo*} (equals signs)\" => \"?\" + (\"=\" * 2000) + \"!\",","+      \"{?foo*,bar}\" => \"?\" + (\"a=\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+      \"{&foo*}\" => \"&\" + (\"a=\" * 1000) + \"!\"","+    }.each do |name, payload|","+      it \"rejects a long payload for #{name} in linear time\" do","+        template = Addressable::Template.new(name.split(\" \").first)","+        expect do","+          Timeout.timeout(10) do","+            expect(template.match(payload)).to be_nil","+          end","+        end.not_to raise_error","+      end","+    end","+  end","+end"],"additions":176,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"spec/addressable/template_spec.rb","lines":["@@ -1140,6 +1140,24 @@ def self.match(name)","           end.not_to raise_error","         end","       end","+      {","+        \"{/foo*}\" => \"/\" + (\"a/\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+        \"/prefix{/foo*}\" => \"/prefix/\" + (\"a/\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+        \"{.foo*}\" => \".\" + (\"a.\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+        \"{;foo*}\" => \";\" + (\"a=1;\" * 1000) + \"!\",","+        \"{;foo*} (members without values)\" => \";\" + (\"ab;\" * 1000) + \"!\"","+      }.each do |pattern, payload|","+        context \"#{pattern} against a payload starting with its operator\" do","+          subject { Addressable::Template.new(pattern.split(\" \").first) }","+          it \"should match in linear time against a non-matching payload\" do","+            expect do","+              Timeout.timeout(10) do","+                expect(subject.match(payload)).to be_nil","+              end","+            end.not_to raise_error","+          end","+        end","+      end","       context \"? operator with explode modifier\" do","         subject { Addressable::Template.new(\"{?foo*}\") }","         it \"should match in linear time against a non-matching payload\" do",""],"additions":18,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":211,"deletions":2,"truncated":false,"file_count":4},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:02:33.957817+00:00"}